# API

## Login
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "", 
    "password": "", 
    "rememberMe": false
}

## Forgot
GET http://localhost:9091/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9091/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer 

## Register / Signup
GET http://localhost:9091/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": ""
}